<title>AUSTRALIA: Interstar sets A$300 mln of mortgage backed debt.</title>
<headline>Interstar sets A$300 mln of mortgage backed debt.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's Interstar Securities Pty Ltd said on Friday it is making its first public offering of A$300 million of mortgaged-backed certificates.</p>
</text>
